WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:04.066
"So why Tahiti what brought you here?"

00:00:04.066 --> 00:00:05.815
"I wanna chase adventures"

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.120
Hello who is this guy?

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.700
 

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.982
What's it like sailing out there all alone?

00:00:14.982 --> 00:00:19.439
You're either sleep-deprived or seasick and after a few days there's hallucinations!

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:20.750
Why did you do it?

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.400
Theres a feeling I can't describe

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.240
Its just you and the infinite horizon

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:34.340
How would you like to sail the Hassana to California first?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.340
What do you think?

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.620
I think 4,000 miles is insane.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:41.360
I'm not going anywhere without you. Come sail with me.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.460
Bon voyage lovers!

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.320
" Hurricane Raymond has taken an unexpected turn"

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.460
"And has been upgraded to a Category 5"

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.460
We need to make sure everything is secure.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.460
Should we be worried?

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.940
I love you!

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.760
Get below!

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:10.740
Oh my God.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.740
Richard!

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.320
Richard!

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.520
It's gonna be okay!

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.520
I'm gonna take care of you.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:39.380
We're thousands of miles from land, we are not in any flight paths that's like a 1,500 square mile search area.

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.740
A needle in a blue haystack.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.860
Is anybody there?

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:43.780
Mayday!

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.640
My ribs are broken my leg shattered. I'm dead weight

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:57.220
What if we sail to Hawaii? It's about 2,000 miles shot at a moving target if you miss Hawaii..

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.340
If we miss Hawaii we die!

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:01.300
I can't do this.

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.160
You can do anything you put your mind to

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:14.040
I sailed half way around the world to find you

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.260
I'm not letting you go!

